LayerStudio synthetic sample pack
=================================
All WAV files in this directory tree were procedurally generated for LayerStudio
via tool/generate_samples.py.

License: CC0 1.0 Universal (public domain dedication).
No third-party sample packs are included.

Drum and melodic samples (bass/guitar/keys) are stereo (2-channel) so live
SoLoud Freeverb inserts can activate. Melodic presets also include multi-root
banks (e.g. bass C1/C2/C3, guitar E1/E2/E3, keys C3/C4/C5) so playback can
pick the nearest root and rate-pitch only residual semitones.

Drum kits (12): Trap Heat, Boom Bap Classic, Drill Dark, Lo-Fi Chill,
House Pulse, Techno Drive, Synthwave Neon, Club Electro, Acoustic Rock,
Indie Garage, Soft Brush, Punk Punch. Regenerated with punchier kicks,
clearer snares/hats, and soft-clip mix.
